@startuml UC9_ConnectSerialPort
title UC9: Connect Serial Port - Use Case Specification

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "UC9: Connect Serial Port" {
    usecase "Scan Ports" as Scan
    usecase "Select Port" as Select
    usecase "Connect" as Connect
    usecase "Disconnect" as Disconnect
}

User --> Scan
User --> Select
User --> Connect
User --> Disconnect

note right of Scan
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Serial ports available trên hệ thống
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Danh sách ports được hiển thị
  
  **Main Flow:**
  1. User click "Refresh Ports"
  2. ConnectionPanelHelper gọi controller
  3. SerialConnectionImpl scan:
     - /dev/ttyUSB* (Linux)
     - /dev/ttyACM* (Linux)
  4. Dropdown được cập nhật
end note

note right of Connect
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Port đã được chọn
  - Port không bị sử dụng bởi app khác
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Serial connection established
  - Read thread đang chạy
  - UI hiển thị "Connected"
  
  **Main Flow:**
  1. User chọn port, click "Connect"
  2. AppController.connectToPort(name)
  3. SerialConnectionImpl.connect(name, 115200)
  4. Open port với O_RDWR | O_NOCTTY
  5. Configure termios: 115200, 8N1
  6. SerialIOImpl.startReading()
  7. Spawn background read thread
  8. UI update status "Connected"
  
  **Alternative Flow:**
  A1. Port không mở được:
      - Error: "Permission denied" hoặc "Device busy"
      - UI hiển thị error message
      
  A2. Port bị disconnect bất ngờ:
      - Read thread phát hiện
      - Cleanup resources
      - UI update "Disconnected"
end note

note right of Disconnect
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Đang connected
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Connection closed
  - Read thread stopped
  - Resources freed
  
  **Main Flow:**
  1. User click "Disconnect"
  2. AppController.disconnect()
  3. SerialIOImpl.stopReading()
  4. Join read thread
  5. SerialConnectionImpl.disconnect()
  6. Close file descriptor
  7. UI update "Disconnected"
end note

@enduml
